# Trivy ignore list for ghcr.io/penguintechinc/waddleai/ollama (hardened + debug).
#
# Two independent, unrelated categories of finding are ignored here. Do NOT
# blanket-carry this file forward on a version/base bump without re-running
# `trivy image --severity HIGH,CRITICAL ghcr.io/penguintechinc/waddleai/ollama:hardened`
# (no --ignorefile) to see the live list first.
#
# --- 1. Go module CVEs baked into the vendored upstream binary ---------------
# `gobinary`-class findings against usr/bin/ollama's embedded Go module build
# info (golang.org/x/*, stdlib, github.com/buger/jsonparser) — from
# ollama/ollama:0.32.13's own build, not introduced by this Dockerfile.
# Fixing these needs either a newer upstream release built with patched Go
# modules, or a from-source rebuild with a current Go toolchain — the latter
# is explicitly out of scope for spec §10.2 ("digest-pinned upstream base",
# not a from-source rebuild).
CVE-2026-25679
